---
title: Secuencia — Transferencia exitosa (Fase 2)
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant F as Frontend
    participant G as API Gateway
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant T as Transaction
    participant A as Account
    participant P as Payment
    participant N as Notification & Audit

    Note over MQ,T: Previo: un ADMIN verifica el KYC (PATCH /api/customers/:id/kyc).<br/>Customer publica customer.kyc.status.changed y Transaction<br/>actualiza su proyección local customer_kyc_status.

    C->>F: elige cuenta origen, destino y monto
    F->>G: POST /api/transfers + JWT
    G->>A: GET /api/accounts/:sourceAccount (ownership)
    A-->>G: customerId de la cuenta
    G->>MQ: transaction.transfer.requested (correlationId = X-Correlation-Id)
    G-->>F: 202 { correlationId, status: PENDING }

    MQ->>T: transaction.transfer.requested
    T->>T: proyección KYC = VERIFIED ✓ · crea transacción PENDING
    T->>MQ: transaction.created + transaction.status.changed (PENDING)

    MQ->>A: transaction.created
    A->>A: valida cuentas, saldo mínimo y comisión · reserva fondos
    A->>MQ: account.funds.reserved

    par Transaction avanza
        MQ->>T: account.funds.reserved
        T->>T: PROCESSING
    and Payment procesa
        MQ->>P: account.funds.reserved
        P->>P: procesador externo simulado → SUCCESS
        P->>MQ: payment.approved
    end

    MQ->>A: payment.approved
    A->>A: debita origen, acredita destino, libera reserva
    A->>MQ: account.transfer.completed

    MQ->>T: account.transfer.completed
    T->>T: COMPLETED
    T->>MQ: transaction.completed + transaction.status.changed (APPROVED)

    MQ->>N: todos los eventos (mismo correlationId)
    N->>N: audita, clasifica (INFO/WARNING/ERROR) y notifica
    N->>MQ: notification.classified

    loop cada 1,5 s hasta un estado final
        F->>G: GET /api/transfers/:correlationId
        G->>T: GET /api/transactions/correlation/:correlationId
        T-->>G: estado (404 mientras no se consume el comando)
        G-->>F: estado + failureReason
    end
    F-->>C: badge "Completada" y saldo actualizado
